  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Henry3
  <Text>k__BackingField: But I showed them. I grew carrots all over these mountain
    islands! Except now, there's too many carrots and I'm struggling to keep up.
    Maybe you could help me out?
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I'll help you out.
